From 182f34e6f58a797c90a438e8af3a3bb4a7c1d5dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quiet-of-far <145577751+Quiet-of-far@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:51:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(power): integrate capacity cap with shared charging
 inhibition

Retain the standard end threshold and fixed five-point hysteresis.
Read both gauges and feed the existing stop, FFC, JEITA and retry policy.
Keep manual inhibition independent and avoid redundant change events.

Signed-off-by: Quiet-of-far <145577751+Quiet-of-far@users.noreply.github.com>
---
